# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# The working tree is bind-mounted into Linux containers, and scalafmt formats
# to LF. Without this, a checkout on Windows rewrites sources to CRLF and the
# format gate fails on every file. Pinning the line endings in the index keeps
# the build deterministic across operating systems.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows cannot mark scripts as executable; keep it simple and portable.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf